SUMMARY:Product — Observe a real workflow and merchant friction
DESCRIPTION:Choose a workflow you actually repeat and note concrete frictio
 n as it occurs\; label this as personal observation.\nOpen Shopify Communi
 ty: https://community.shopify.com/\nInspect recent merchant discussions fo
 r current behavior\, manual workarounds\, recurring effort/cost or switchi
 ng between paid apps. Save strong thread links if you find them\; note who
  is affected\, what they do\, recurrence and consequence. Separate merchan
 t accounts from partner/staff replies. Ignore vague complaints\, feature w
 ishes and resolved questions. Stop when a concrete follow-up emerges\; do 
 not invent a product idea.
END:VEVENT
