SUMMARY:Markets — Why markets exist
DESCRIPTION:First briefly explain: why would a business use a market\, and 
 who participates?\nRead SEBI's Securities Market: Understanding from Inves
 tor's Perspective:\nhttps://investor.sebi.gov.in/pdf/reference-material/la
 nguages/english/SM%20Booklet_English%20-%20Final%20%28Low%29.pdf\nUse PDF 
 page numbers (cover = 1):\np7: entries A and D only.\np8: two prose paragr
 aphs on markets/allocation of savings\; skip diagram.\np9: opening definit
 ion\, two issuer categories and IPO definition.\np10: two bullets on new s
 hares versus an existing holder's sale\, plus Secondary market paragraph.\
 npp11–12: institutional/intermediary descriptions\; stop before Basics o
 f Investing.\np13: liquidity-risk and business-risk entries only.\nClose i
 t and explain the economic need\, motives and risks. Skip procedures/timet
 ables\; this older booklet teaches concepts\, not current rules.
END:VEVENT
